events.source:
=== chat.video
case: case_artist_1
type: chat
title: "制作过程视频 · 完整对话"
day: 1
through: 5
slot: any
status: final
when: true
trigger: "早上或下午，尚未制作视频。读完画师解释后确认；回复展示完再推进两个时段。"

@action: request_video
玩家:
  Can you record a time-lapse speed paint video as evidence?
@line_id: "bl_tjnpm8_line_0"

画师:
  Of course! It'll take a while, and I'll need to focus on making the video. Do you think I should work on it now?
@line_id: "bl_tjnpm8_line_1"

系统: 
  It will take two time slots for Iris to finish recording and posting the video. 

* [Make a process video]
  @choice_id: "bl_tjnpm8_choice_3"
  玩家:
    Let's make one. We can keep it short and use the process notes and WIPs you've already shared.
  @line_id: "bl_tjnpm8_line_4"

  画师:
    Okay. I'll put them together, but I'll need to focus on this for a while. I might be slow to reply.
  @line_id: "bl_tjnpm8_line_5"

  画师:
    作画过程视频已经发布了。希望大家看过以后，能更了解我是怎么画的。
  @line_id: "bl_tjnpm8_line_6"

  @show_post: post_block_f6w1qy
  @action: approve_video
  -> END

* [Not now]
  @choice_id: "bl_tjnpm8_choice_7"
  玩家:
    Let's hold off for now. Your process notes and WIPs are already available, so I can direct people to those.
  @line_id: "bl_tjnpm8_line_8"

  画师:
    Thanks. lmk if you need it next time. 
  @line_id: "bl_tjnpm8_line_9"

  @action: decline_video
  -> END

