events.source:
=== artist2_comment_options
case: case_artist_2
type: system
title: "评论回复 · 可选文案"
day: 1
through: 5
slot: any
status: final
when: true
trigger: "replySheet()：支持评论只有感谢；质疑评论按已收集的证据显示对应选项。"

@notes: "转录自 index.html 的现有文案与流程；replySheet()：支持评论只有感谢；质疑评论按已收集的证据显示对应选项。"

* [说得对，谢谢支持！]
  @choice_id: "artist2_comment_options_choice_0"
  @action: reply_support
  -> END

* [这是证据：约稿之前就有的草稿]
  @choice_id: "artist2_comment_options_choice_1"
  @when: evidence("e1")
  @action: rebut_evidence
  -> END

* [这是证据：约稿时间线截图]
  @choice_id: "bl_1wqmxl7_choice_0"
  @when: evidence("e2")
  @action: rebut_evidence
  -> END

* [这是证据：分层源文件]
  @choice_id: "bl_1wqmxl7_choice_1"
  @when: evidence("e3")
  @action: rebut_evidence
  -> END

* [这是证据：未剪辑的绘画录屏]
  @choice_id: "bl_1wqmxl7_choice_2"
  @when: evidence("e4")
  @action: rebut_evidence
  -> END

* [这是证据：客户布丁的两次约稿过程记录]
  @choice_id: "bl_1wqmxl7_choice_3"
  @when: evidence("e5")
  @action: rebut_evidence
  -> END

* [这是证据：客户青柠的订单核对记录]
  @choice_id: "bl_1wqmxl7_choice_4"
  @when: evidence("e6")
  @action: rebut_evidence
  -> END

* [这是证据：第 5 天直播对赌公告与规则]
  @choice_id: "bl_1wqmxl7_choice_5"
  @when: evidence("livestream-announcement")
  @action: rebut_evidence
  -> END

* [这是没有根据的猜测。]
  @choice_id: "artist2_comment_options_choice_2"
  @action: rebut_no_evidence
  -> END

